v class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-840453d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"840453d\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-0bb4a7b\" data-id=\"0bb4a7b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-949d461 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"949d461\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>\u00bfQu\u00e9 es el mantenimiento SAP?<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01623ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"01623ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">El mantenimiento SAP consiste en un conjunto de actividades orientadas a preservar la estabilidad, disponibilidad y rendimiento de los sistemas SAP utilizados dentro de una organizaci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Su prop\u00f3sito es garantizar que la plataforma contin\u00fae funcionando correctamente, respondiendo a las necesidades operativas actuales y futuras del negocio.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A diferencia del soporte reactivo, el mantenimiento busca anticiparse a los problemas mediante revisiones peri\u00f3dicas, monitoreo y optimizaci\u00f3n continua.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-95cd45a\" data-id=\"95cd45a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9aebabe elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"9aebabe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-25947f0 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"25947f0\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0539884\" data-id=\"0539884\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b870d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"5b870d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e283471\" data-id=\"e283471\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-caea058 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"caea058\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-1c1e12a\" data-id=\"1c1e12a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c98659 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9c98659\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 es importante el mantenimiento SAP?<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d535eb4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"d535eb4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"sap-247\">\r\n  <style>\r\n    \/* Estilos base del contenedor *\/\r\n    .sap-247 {\r\n      font-size: 14px;\r\n      color: #000000;\r\n      line-height: 1.5;\r\n      max-width: 800px;\r\n      margin: 0 auto;\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    .sap-247 p {\r\n      color: #000000;\r\n      margin: 0 0 1em 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* Estilos para los H3 con bullet magenta incorporado *\/\r\n    .sap-247 h3 {\r\n      color: #071C3B; \/* Azul profundo *\/\r\n      font-size: 16px; \r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      margin: 1.5em 0 0.5em 0;\r\n      position: relative;\r\n      padding-left: 20px; \/* Espacio para el bullet *\/\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    \/* Creaci\u00f3n del bullet para el H3 *\/\r\n    .sap-247 h3::before {\r\n      content: \"\";\r\n      background-color: #EE5781; \/* Magenta *\/\r\n      width: 8px;\r\n      height: 8px;\r\n      border-radius: 50%;\r\n      position: absolute;\r\n      left: 2px;\r\n      top: 0.5em; \/* Alineaci\u00f3n vertical *\/\r\n    }\r\n  <\/style>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Reduce el riesgo de interrupciones<\/h3>\r\n  <p>La detecci\u00f3n temprana de posibles fallas ayuda a prevenir incidentes que podr\u00edan afectar la operaci\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Mejora el rendimiento del sistema<\/h3>\r\n  <p>La optimizaci\u00f3n continua permite mantener tiempos de respuesta adecuados y una mejor experiencia para los usuarios.<\/p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Protege la inversi\u00f3n tecnol\u00f3gica<\/h3>\r\n  <p>Un mantenimiento adecuado contribuye a prolongar la vida \u00fatil del entorno SAP y maximizar el retorno de inversi\u00f3n.<\/p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Facilita la evoluci\u00f3n del negocio<\/h3>\r\n  <p>Los cambios organizacionales requieren plataformas tecnol\u00f3gicas preparadas para adaptarse a nuevas necesidades.<\/p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Incrementa la productividad<\/h3>\r\n  <p>Los usuarios pueden desarrollar sus actividades con mayor eficiencia cuando cuentan con sistemas estables.<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-39a92de elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"39a92de\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-951d037\" data-id=\"951d037\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bba4089 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bba4089\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>\u00bfQu\u00e9 incluye un servicio de mantenimiento SAP?<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7614a13 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"7614a13\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<link href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Raleway:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<style>\r\n  .sap-grid-container-dark {\r\n    font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;\r\n    font-size: 1em;\r\n    color: #000000;\r\n    line-height: 1.25;\r\n    max-width: 1000px;\r\n    margin: 0 auto;\r\n    \r\n    \/* Configuraci\u00f3n avanzada de la rejilla *\/\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); \/* 6 columnas base para dividir en 3 y 2 *\/\r\n    column-gap: 25px;\r\n    row-gap: 25px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/* Asignaci\u00f3n de espacios para la cuadr\u00edcula en pantallas grandes *\/\r\n  .card-1 { grid-column: span 2; } \/* Fila 1 - Columna 1 (ocupa 2 de 6) *\/\r\n  .card-2 { grid-column: span 2; } \/* Fila 1 - Columna 2 (ocupa 2 de 6) *\/\r\n  .card-3 { grid-column: span 2; } \/* Fila 1 - Columna 3 (ocupa 2 de 6) *\/\r\n  \r\n  